version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-06"
license: Apache-2.0
type: software
abstract: >
  A public framework and template set for operationalizing the NIST CSF 2.0
  GOVERN function through control records, evidence architecture, governance
  registers, review workflows, maturity assessments, and accountable
  remediation. Current release (v0.1.0) provides the framework documentation and template set; GV.OC control instantiation is planned.

